# DESK34 -- a sub-directory opened from inside a window.
#
# Both acceptance cases in ONE run, as the ticket asks:
#   C_FOLDER  the SUB folder opened from window 1  -> same frame, new title
#   D_DRIVE   the C: drive icon opened from the desktop -> a NEW window
#
# Every coordinate comes from the d-probe2 dump on THIS card image
# (method/seed.sh qedroot):
#   C: drive icon  box (0,19) 76x40 -> click (38,35); (37,42) is the same icon
#                  and the point the earlier runs used -- left of window 1's
#                  left edge (48), so it stays clickable with a window open
#   'SUB'          box (477,87) 76x40 -> click (515,103)   (window 1, slot 0)
#
# POINTER PARK: (600,240) -- clear of the desktop icons and of the menu bar.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
